{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Upper Blackrock Spire: Goraluk Anvilcrack fights with Ascension's kit",
  "contract": [
    "Goraluk Anvilcrack keeps Strike, Head Crack and Backhand and adds the abilities of Ascension's kit for",
    "him (db.exil.es/npc/10899): Fierce Blow 975011, Stunning Strike 2102553 and his two stacking",
    "self-enchants, Enchant Armor - Protection V 2102138 and Enchant Pickaxe - Efficieny V 2102137. Fierce",
    "Blow and Strike are both original next-swing spells and share CURRENT_MELEE_SPELL, where a later queue",
    "replaces the earlier one. Original SmartAI schedules Strike every 4-6 seconds and Fierce Blow every 6-8",
    "seconds, so demanding the first Fierce Blow within fifteen seconds can fail despite a working native",
    "rotation. Observe 240 seconds of ordinary accelerated combat, maintaining the already authored",
    "high-health observer every four seconds, before requiring every original kit packet. Boss timers, queued",
    "spell replacement and hit rolls are unchanged. Head Crack recomputes player maximum health from native",
    "stat modifiers, replacing a direct maximum-field override. Original 2156414 applies only a +10000000",
    "flat health aura and lasts seven days. Supply and assert that native modifier, its lifetime and the",
    "resulting maximum before combat, refill health within that derived maximum, and require the same native",
    "maximum and survival after the sample. It changes no armor, hit, damage, timers or spell selection.",
    "Apply the original persistent health budget before the initial settling wait: the spawned boss is",
    "already aggressive at melee range, so waiting with ordinary base health can leave no living observer on",
    "which to apply the later aura. Require survival before and after settling; raw health refills do not",
    "resurrect a dead actor."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 400000,
  "location": {
    "map": 229,
    "x": 141.0,
    "y": -242.7,
    "z": 110.9,
    "o": 0.0,
    "ignore_access": true
  },
